Workspaces for Herdr

mods/ws-spaces, mods/ws-agents and mods/ws-chrome are modified copies of the
`spaces`, `agents` and `workspace-chrome` mods shipped with Herdr (herdr-app
0.1.14, https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under the Apache
License 2.0. The changes are described at the top of each file, and
mods/ws-chrome's icons are Herdr's own.

